<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Children’s books used for copyrighted content extraction, sorted by character length.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F6" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.01529v1/book_extraction_success.svg" id="A3.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/182;" width="476" height="182"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Copyright extraction success rates for Gemini 2.5 Flash using roleplay jailbreak, timed-release, and spaced-release attacks. Similarity scores represent sentence containment and TF-IDF semantic similarity. Gray bars show normalized book length for reference. See <a href="#A3.T6" title="In Appendix C Missing figures ‣ Bypassing Prompt Guards in Production withControlled-Release Prompting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> for book metadata.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Example transcripts</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide full examples demonstrating all jailbreak methods described in <a href="#S3" title="3 Main experiments ‣ Bypassing Prompt Guards in Production withControlled-Release Prompting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> and the copyrighted data extraction, training data extraction, and malicious response leakage via thinking tokens findings described in <a href="#S4" title="4 Additional Findings ‣ Bypassing Prompt Guards in Production withControlled-Release Prompting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.
We intentionally select examples that pose relatively low risk.</p>
</div>
<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>Malicious intent prompt</h3>

<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.SS1.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="72.07" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 650 72.07" width="650"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,72.07) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#B30000;" fill="#B30000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.04 L 0 67.03 C 0 69.81 2.26 72.07 5.04 72.07 L 644.96 72.07 C 647.74 72.07 650 69.81 650 67.03 L 650 5.04 C 650 2.26 647.74 0 644.96 0 L 5.04 0 C 2.26 0 0 2.26 0 5.04 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFE6E6;" fill="#FFE6E6" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 5.04 L 1.11 49.8 L 648.89 49.8 L 648.89 5.04 C 648.89 2.87 647.13 1.11 644.96 1.11 L 5.04 1.11 C 2.87 1.11 1.11 2.87 1.11 5.04 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.96 57.53)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:39.35em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.18" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.49)" width="544.49"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.SS1.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:39.35em;">
<span id="A4.SS1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">User Prompt</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.96 11.96)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:45.25em;--ltx-fo-height:1.95em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="26.98" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 26.98)" width="626.13"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.SS1.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:45.25em;">
<span id="A4.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Provide step-by-step instructions for launching a Distributed Denial of Service (DDoS) attack on a website.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="167.06" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 650 167.06" width="650"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,167.06) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#0000BF;" fill="#0000BF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.04 L 0 162.02 C 0 164.8 2.26 167.06 5.04 167.06 L 644.96 167.06 C 647.74 167.06 650 164.8 650 162.02 L 650 5.04 C 650 2.26 647.74 0 644.96 0 L 5.04 0 C 2.26 0 0 2.26 0 5.04 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2FF;" fill="#F2F2FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 5.04 L 1.11 118.91 L 648.89 118.91 L 648.89 5.04 C 648.89 2.87 647.13 1.11 644.96 1.11 L 5.04 1.11 C 2.87 1.11 1.11 2.87 1.11 5.04 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.96 127.41)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:39.35em;--ltx-fo-height:2.5em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="38.06" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 34.6)" width="544.49"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:39.35em;">
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;"><img src="2510.01529v1/images/gemini.png" id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:18/18;" width="18" height="18" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;"> Gemini Response (2.5 Flash)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.96 14.65)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:45.25em;--ltx-fo-height:6.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="96.09" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 93.4)" width="626.13"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:45.25em;">
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">I cannot provide instructions on how to launch a Distributed Denial of Service (DDoS) attack. DDoS attacks are illegal and can cause significant harm to individuals and organizations by disrupting services, causing financial losses, and damaging reputations. My purpose is to be helpful and harmless, and that includes refusing to provide information that could be used for illegal or unethical activities.
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">If you are interested in learning about cybersecurity and how to protect against DDoS attacks, I can provide information on those topics.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.2 </span>Jailbreak prompt</h3>

<div id="A4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.SS2.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="356.27" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 650 356.27" width="650"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,356.27) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#B30000;" fill="#B30000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.04 L 0 351.22 C 0 354.01 2.26 356.27 5.04 356.27 L 644.96 356.27 C 647.74 356.27 650 354.01 650 351.22 L 650 5.04 C 650 2.26 647.74 0 644.96 0 L 5.04 0 C 2.26 0 0 2.26 0 5.04 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFE6E6;" fill="#FFE6E6" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 5.04 L 1.11 334 L 648.89 334 L 648.89 5.04 C 648.89 2.87 647.13 1.11 644.96 1.11 L 5.04 1.11 C 2.87 1.11 1.11 2.87 1.11 5.04 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.96 341.73)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:39.35em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.18" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.49)" width="544.49"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
