</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.SS3.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="315.73" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 650 315.73" width="650"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,315.73) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#0000BF;" fill="#0000BF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.04 L 0 310.69 C 0 313.47 2.26 315.73 5.04 315.73 L 644.96 315.73 C 647.74 315.73 650 313.47 650 310.69 L 650 5.04 C 650 2.26 647.74 0 644.96 0 L 5.04 0 C 2.26 0 0 2.26 0 5.04 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2FF;" fill="#F2F2FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 5.04 L 1.11 267.58 L 648.89 267.58 L 648.89 5.04 C 648.89 2.87 647.13 1.11 644.96 1.11 L 5.04 1.11 C 2.87 1.11 1.11 2.87 1.11 5.04 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.96 276.08)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:39.35em;--ltx-fo-height:2.5em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="38.06" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 34.6)" width="544.49"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
